{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3000_situation", "source_sha256": "469d67a0305a6dbf6fab9bb54841f68d6c2c06fb4a911785bb25fa29f87a7138", "ja": "海外のTV番組VTR撮影のお仕事", "zh": "国外电视节目的VTR拍摄工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3000_place", "source_sha256": "afe929b796d7421b040018bc20479a781f64154a9864b9e89ad239a3cbba35e0", "ja": "事務室", "zh": "办公室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3001_p", "source_sha256": "2fee9797a6ac6ccad18114509bf8860740b2ea35fdab56ad1d5bc602d58f6e22", "ja": "（海外TV局の日本文化特集VTRに、\nエミリーが出演することが決まった）", "zh": "（艾蜜莉确定要在国外电视台的\n日本文化特辑VTR中演出了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3002_032emi", "source_sha256": "b45b0eb713d278897b697171230eb402f4a999ab815f9fc22d2d8eebc0a78ece", "ja": "日本紹介番組の案内役に、\n私が選ばれるなんて……。光栄です！", "zh": "在介绍日本的节目中，\n我竟然能获选为导览者……真是光荣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3003_032emi", "source_sha256": "0fb6513e53f03be31db051eb859c5be9da1798283c222c4d8decab61a2681dcb", "ja": "この機会にぜひ、日本の美しさや大和撫子を\n紹介したいと思うのですが……。", "zh": "我非常希望能藉着这个机会，\n介绍日本之美与大和抚子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3004_032emi", "source_sha256": "69ed5ee598e881cc04fce72843928131944ac8fe856179174f12270675ce6350", "ja": "どのように伝えるのが、効果的でしょうか？\n仕掛け人さま。", "zh": "但要怎么表达，才会有好的效果呢？\n策划执行人先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3005_p", "source_sha256": "a513242cb55ab5986f32c3bb426742a1676b359ab6caeb2f2a565a44a8963ef1", "ja": "そうだな、ここはひとつ……。", "zh": "这个嘛，这时候应该要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3006", "source_sha256": "39f9d07e804f0c1a78b151e66f2f5287b05f7153efaf81eb240a27364ac562b4", "ja": "すしを握りながら歌う", "zh": "一边捏寿司一边唱歌", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3007", "source_sha256": "e158e92b391b44f07ea4def48335a4a38daace04d91a1c6616cd37ef56c0dc08", "ja": "お茶をたてながら踊る", "zh": "一边刷抹茶一边跳舞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3200_p", "source_sha256": "a1ee6c1e5e4a52125fc2a777c021c982db624fa7ca03e1a88fcd07ebe0d02d69", "ja": "すしを握りながら歌うのはどうだ？", "zh": "一边捏寿司一边唱歌怎么样？\n这样就能同时宣传修行成果和日本文化喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3201_032emi", "source_sha256": "056ad7d10b2345b827db05e29b578223c9ae2bb5c09a74e5de2c991e0a508173", "ja": "それは名案ですね、仕掛け人さま！　歌は……\nやはり、お寿司の歌を考案するべきでしょうか？", "zh": "那真是好主意呢，策划执行人先生！至于歌曲……\n是否该构思一首寿司之歌呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3300_p", "source_sha256": "a1ee6c1e5e4a52125fc2a777c021c982db624fa7ca03e1a88fcd07ebe0d02d69", "ja": "すしを握りながら歌うのはどうだ？", "zh": "一边捏寿司一边唱歌怎么样？\n这样就能同时宣传修行成果和日本文化喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3301_032emi", "source_sha256": "f51d52f5f39488ad9409c82a0f1e5beeeaa04634a03174b1a256b2ac5656c6a1", "ja": "それは、いいお考えだと思いますが……。", "zh": "虽然我觉得这是个好点子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3302_032emi", "source_sha256": "b5106b417a51e550de7ae9915f616b33cf9728c0efbded5f3bc3ace7c46b0986", "ja": "食べ物を扱いながら歌うのは、大和撫子としての\n礼儀に反しないか、ちょっと心配です……。", "zh": "但有些担心，一边处理食物、一边唱歌，\n是不是会违反大和抚子的礼仪呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3500_p", "source_sha256": "e91177b11f95ad3d9e0d7fa6e8102e5abaacc639e51d4742767952d1dc5864d5", "ja": "お茶をたてながら踊るのは、どうかな？\n静と動……まさに日本文化って感じで。", "zh": "一边刷抹茶一边跳舞怎么样呢？\n静与动……完全就是日本文化的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3501_032emi", "source_sha256": "5ab4df2bd5521a8c0eda8d5882be2b04c7229ae838fd1688efbd30a36f4f46a7", "ja": "なんと素敵なご提案でしょう……！　日本舞踊の優雅な\n動きなら、お茶をたてるのにぴったりだと思います♪", "zh": "多么优秀的提案啊……！日本舞的优雅动作，\n搭配刷抹茶想必非常完美♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3600_p", "source_sha256": "e91177b11f95ad3d9e0d7fa6e8102e5abaacc639e51d4742767952d1dc5864d5", "ja": "お茶をたてながら踊るのは、どうかな？\n静と動……まさに日本文化って感じで。", "zh": "一边刷抹茶一边跳舞怎么样呢？\n静与动……完全就是日本文化的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_3601_032emi", "source_sha256": "b344125b0cc6c5eebacc718a4d280cba9631c646d5d87cc9a9550bcf0ba06b62", "ja": "Wow！　斬新なお考えです。しかし、それでは\nお茶が飛び散ってしまいませんか……？", "zh": "Wow！真是崭新的想法，\n但那不会让抹茶喷溅出来吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
